    "native CustomBuffer listener null error branch ignores even an invalid replacement result",
    "native CustomBuffer listener commits the actual returned view for the next allocation",
    "native CustomBuffer listener actual descriptor reads reuse caller buffers through FileHandle completion",
    "native CustomBuffer listener actual ordinary and uncatchable callback throws preserve the original buffer",
    "native CustomBuffer listener does not retain the actual external buffer or its JavaScript view",
    "native CustomBuffer listener native deletion unlinks the live head before releasing its exact charge",
    "native CustomBuffer listener interior deletion preserves the actual remaining listener chain",
    "native CustomBuffer listener StreamBase destruction consumes its actual self deleting chain",
    "native CustomBuffer listener unlinked allocation survives Engine teardown and retires without a context",
    "native CustomBuffer listener callback may destroy the actual listener and return undefined",
    "native CustomBuffer listener selects the genuine shutdown reporter for the real native close request"
